    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0c327fc2",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: motivational_advice; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man standing confidently next to hay bales in a field, with overlaid text that reads 'if you want something get off your ass and earn it.' The overall intent is to deliver a motivational or inspirational message encouraging personal responsibility, hard work, and self-reliance. The visual of the man in a rural, labor-intensive setting reinforces the theme of effort and achievement through action. There is no toxicity present in this meme; it does not target any specific group or individual based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, hateful, cyberbullying, harmful, misogynistic, or propagandistic content. The intent is purely motivational, using the juxtaposition of the image (a hardworking farmer) with the text to convey a message of self-determination and perseverance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_bac5e365"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
