      "description": "A middle-aged man wearing a blue cap, a red and orange striped shirt, and blue jeans, standing confidently next to large hay bales in a field. He is leaning against one bale with one hand on his hip, conveying a sense of hard work and determination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
